    "body": "I think what I'm talking about might only be observable through https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/parsing.html#tree-construction-dispatcher and I'm not sure your example ends up hitting that.\n\nAlso, https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/12756 will deeply integrate the sanitizer into the parser and for other cases we decided on a model differently from what you suggest.\n\ncc @zcorpan @noamr ",
